// Street-level crime near a coordinate (central London).
// Orbital calls https://data.police.uk/api/crimes-street/all-crime and maps the
// response onto the uk.gov taxonomy (CrimeCategory, Latitude, Longitude, ...).
given { lat : uk.gov.Latitude = 51.5072, lng : uk.gov.Longitude = -0.1276 }
find { uk.gov.apis.police_uk.StreetCrime[] }
